# Build-context excludes shared across every microservice Dockerfile.
# Keeps secrets out of the image and shrinks the upload to the daemon.

# Per-service installs run inside the image — never copy host-side modules.
**/node_modules

# Secrets / local-dev config (compose injects production env vars instead).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# VCS / IDE / OS
.git
.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Test + tooling artefacts not needed at runtime.
**/coverage
**/dist
**/build
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/.cache

# Docs / GH metadata
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
.github
